## 🛠️ Available Agent Tools

| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `fetch_url` | Fetches HTML from a URL to analyze the site |
| `write_file` | Writes a file to the `output/` directory |
| `read_file` | Reads a file to verify its contents |
| `list_files` | Lists all generated output files |

