## 🔧 Troubleshooting

**`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY not set`** → Run `export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_key`

**`Fetch failed`** → The target website may block scrapers. The agent will still generate a high-quality clone based on its knowledge.

**Output looks basic** → Try: *"Regenerate the clone with more visual details and animations"*

